<!-- drawable/ic_life_mode.xml

     The palm tree from the stock Palm PVG100. Traced from the stock 8.1
     SystemUI's own QS tile asset (res/drawable-xhdpi-v4/ic_qs_lifemode_on.png,
     65x79) rather than redrawn, so the silhouette is the real one.

     Stock shipped two bitmaps, ic_qs_lifemode_on/off, as separate drawings in
     coral and grey. We ship one monochrome vector instead and let the QS
     framework tint it per tile state, which reproduces the same on/off read the
     modern way - and, being a vector, survives this device's odd 264/280dpi
     bucket that would have resampled a fixed-density bitmap.
-->
